name: design
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: |
  A design decision was taken and sealed in the commit — not a defect removed
  (bug-fix), not new capability (capability-gained): a choice among
  alternatives that now carries its reason. The commit note names the
  alternative NOT taken and why, so the next session doesn't relitigate it.

  Declared 2026-09-19 with git-gate-local, whose scoping seam is the
  declaration's own `loc` rather than a `paths` field — colocation costs
  zero syntax, and a paths field would let an invariant claim a file it
  does not live in.
route: surface
